    <div class="commit">
      <div class="ct">
        Regenerative science.<br>
Not trend science.
      </div>

      <div class="cb">
        <p>Longevity is the one true purpose of beauty. The science of how skin renews, repairs, and rebuilds is the only science worth building on.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  
    <div class="commit">
      <div class="ct">
        India is the future<br>
of beauty.
      </div>

      <div class="cb">
        <p>We are an Indian brand that holds itself to a global standard. More money spent on raw materials than on packaging. A limited portfolio built around one system, not a shelf of launches. No trend-chasing, no magic wand claims. The Indian consumer deserves world-class products made here, not world-class products imported and resold. We intend to prove it is possible.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  
    <div class="commit">
      <div class="ct">
        Difficult choices over<br>
popular ones.
      </div>

      <div class="cb">
        <p>We chose the 75-day protocol when 7 days would have been easier to sell. We publish what we put in the formula when opacity would have been easier to defend. We show quantitative clinical data when before/after photography would have been easier to produce. Every difficult choice is a decision about what kind of brand this is.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  

